 SG_ Command : 0|8@1+ (1,0) [0|0] "" Vector__XXX




CM_ BO_ 256 "Liveness and counters. Classic CAN so any tool can read it.";
CM_ BO_ 272 "Simulated sensor values. Classic CAN, 100 ms by default; the rate is changed with SET_RATE on 0x600.";
CM_ BO_ 512 "Diagnostic byte ramp. Its only job is to be a 64-byte FD frame, which a classic-only host cannot receive at all.";
CM_ BO_ 528 "A 16-sample trace in one frame. The same trace over classic CAN is six frames plus a reassembly scheme.";
CM_ BO_ 801 "Echo of a 0x123 request. Length and frame type follow the request, so the DBC can only describe the first bytes.";
CM_ BO_ 1536 "1 = INFO, 2 = COUNTERS, 3 = SET_RATE with Arg in ms.";
CM_ BO_ 1537 "First byte echoes the command, so a reply matches its request without a transaction id.";



VAL_ 1537 Command 1 "INFO" 2 "COUNTERS" 3 "SET_RATE" 255 "ERROR" ;
BA_DEF_ BO_  "VFrameFormat" ENUM  "StandardCAN","ExtendedCAN","reserved","J1939PG","StandardCAN_FD","ExtendedCAN_FD";
BA_DEF_DEF_  "VFrameFormat" "StandardCAN";
BA_ "VFrameFormat" BO_ 512 4;
BA_ "VFrameFormat" BO_ 528 4;
